  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252filyrac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f69e87c0cfd3306fa11c3da477e51544c8d380e2_0.webp\" alt=\"支持我\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ilyrac/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252filyrac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/IlyRac/FarBlockEntityRendering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>Terracart – 地形礦車</h1>\n<p>相容原版的可駕駛礦車——跳上去，用<strong>煤炭</strong>補充燃料，用<strong>鐵</strong>進行修復，從<strong>16種顏色</strong>中挑選一種，然後在你的世界中自由探索。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9bf9852c021c9342a5ab7f016fdca0049a414a02.gif\" alt=\"動態效果-1\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>駕駛</strong>：可騎乘的礦車，移動順暢。</li>\n<li><strong>燃料</strong>：<strong>僅在移動時</strong>消耗燃料；使用<strong>煤炭</strong>補充。</li>\n<li><strong>修復</strong>：使用<strong>鐵</strong>進行修復。</li>\n<li><strong>多彩配色</strong>：可選擇<strong>16種顏色之一</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>生存平衡</strong>：礦車被摧毀後會掉落<strong>原材料</strong>：<strong>3–7個鐵</strong>、<strong>1個輪子</strong>、<strong>1個熔爐</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>HUD顯示</strong>：騎乘時HUD會顯示<em>速度／燃料／生命值</em>。</li>\n<li><strong>音效與粒子</strong>：自訂音效與撞擊粒子，提供清晰的反饋。</li>\n<li><strong>傷害機制</strong>：礦車撞擊生物時會造成傷害。</li>\n<li><strong>原版相容</strong>：設計理念為讓玩家感覺這是原版遊戲的自然延伸。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>🎮 使用方法</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>合成 Terracart 並在放置前<strong>選擇顏色</strong>（選填）。</li>\n<li><strong>燒煉</strong>上色後的礦車以將其還原為預設礦車物品。<ul>\n<li><strong>注意：</strong>礦車<strong>不會</strong>自行掉落。若要更換顏色，必須重新合成新礦車（或在放置前燒煉）。</li></ul></li>\n<li>右鍵點擊以騎乘。</li>\n<li>使用常規移動鍵來駕駛。</li>\n<li><strong>移動時</strong>使用<strong>煤炭</strong>補充燃料（燃料僅在移動時消耗）。</li>\n<li><strong>受損時</strong>使用<strong>鐵</strong>進行修復。</li>\n<li>若礦車被<strong>摧毀</strong>，請收集掉落的材料並重新組裝。</li>\n<li>在你的世界中自由探索，盡情享受吧。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2>🖼️ 圖片展示</h2>\n<p>截圖由 <strong>Shiomate</strong> 製作於 <strong>Umihara City</strong> 地圖中 —— 致以萬分感謝！</p>\n<p>地圖：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fproject%252fumiharacity%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Umihara City 海原</a> —— 作者：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fshiomate%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shiomate</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b5029c90c6e33eae7a0951e5b5fc05f3725ded28.png\" alt=\"停車區\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/addf2fc627b7053fa68a06b385e87776a53fd7eb_0.webp\" alt=\"道路\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3c8c5af5d7d9b7b6cc5186d5e76f69525393c78b.png\" alt=\"全色系\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/82f40934f48fef0304f7a7dc6c9ac53d9bc74a0c_0.webp\" alt=\"動態效果-2\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a1f85e7659e81beed9cb29dfebdeaa32e6a2115a_0.webp\" alt=\"騎乘中\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/acfbb3962e53474cdf42612ce5f1463e740ba109_0.webp\" alt=\"頂視圖\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2d0e4e26df59584e9c751d174e554db2a8f6871f.png\" alt=\"合成配方\"></p>\n<hr>",
